OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome patchy light rain, mainly
OL,6,Fduring the dull and cloudy morning.
OL,7,FLargely dry for the afternoon with the
OL,8,Fchance of some limited brighter spells
OL,9,Fbreaking through. South to southeast
OL,10,Fwinds occasionally brisk around the
OL,11,Fcoasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FPatchy rain early eveniong,
OL,14,Fturning heavy by late evening, then
OL,15,Fclearing to only a few light showers
OL,16,Fovernight. Brisk southerly winds
OL,17,Feasing overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
