OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F172A1791775128
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FShowers and brighter spells.
OL,6,FOutbreaks few and far between around
OL,7,Fthe east coast, but some heavier
OL,8,Foutbreaks possible in the west late
OL,9,Fmorning and early afternoon. Brisk
OL,10,Fsouthwest winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,13,FWednesday very windy with rain
OL,14,Fdeveloping late in the day, which
OL,15,Foccasionally turns heavy. Rain
OL,16,Fclearing erratically Thursday, to a
OL,17,Fmix of scattered showers and brighter
OL,18,Fspells, which continues Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
